  "cues": [
   [
    0.106,
    "Governments soon took notice."
   ],
   [
    2.074,
    "In nineteen seventy-five, the World Meteorological Organization, with funding from the U N Environment Programme, brought scientists together, and issued its first statement on ozone."
   ],
   [
    13.763,
    "That pushed U N E P's Governing Council to make ozone a high priority."
   ],
   [
    18.923,
    "In nineteen seventy-seven, an international meeting adopted a World Plan of Action on the ozone layer."
   ],
   [
    25.625,
    "Its focus: research, and monitoring, coordinated across countries."
   ],
   [
    30.558,
    "Science had put ozone firmly on the political agenda."
   ]
  ]
