  "cues": [
   [
    0.12,
    "To sum up."
   ],
   [
    1.051,
    "Science came first: Molina and Rowland's warning in nineteen seventy-four led to research plans and meetings."
   ],
   [
    8.777,
    "The Vienna Convention was adopted in nineteen eighty-five, entered into force in nineteen eighty-eight, and reached every country in two thousand nine."
   ],
   [
    18.005,
    "As a framework, it sets a general duty to protect the ozone layer, not specific controls, and it acts before full proof: the precautionary approach."
   ],
   [
    28.351,
    "Its bodies are the Conference of the Parties, its Bureau, the Ozone Research Managers, and the Secretariat in Nairobi."
   ],
   [
    35.918,
    "Now, a short practice."
   ]
  ]
